# Install as jvm.options.d/lawhand.options; do not replace the vendor file.
# Size both values to half of dedicated node RAM, capped at 31 GB. The 4 GB
# baseline is for evaluation only; production sizing must follow the runbook.
-Xms4g
-Xmx4g
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-Djava.io.tmpdir=${OPENSEARCH_TMPDIR}
